  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">안녕하세요. 송쌤과학입니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">소니 미러리스 카메라로 촬영을 하였습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">직접 촬영한 후 AI로 디자인 보정만 하였습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">학교에 광물이 없는 경우 사진을 활용하면 되겠습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">그럼에도 알고 있는 정보와 너무 다른 경우 댓글로 알려주시면 수정하겠습니다.<br>감사합니다 :)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a241e76a4f3eed28a9b8087895db888bac641b2c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a241e76a4f3eed28a9b8087895db888bac641b2c\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"2752\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2333e4f4e9df30e3ab3d7dd226858250ff9d9f6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2333e4f4e9df30e3ab3d7dd226858250ff9d9f6\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"2752\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83cb945442f79c158d506f7d8d1d2131eef1227c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83cb945442f79c158d506f7d8d1d2131eef1227c\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"2752\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8975096f169de5e75640dd4bc178987957c06ece\" cla